  library packages used here. It is used as an unmodified dependency for audited
  secp256k1 / Keccak-256 / RLP / EVM transaction primitives.
- Other dependencies (Hono, Kysely, viem, @noble/*, AWS SDK for Go v2, etc.) are
  distributed under their respective MIT/Apache-2.0/BSD licenses.

See each component's dependency manifest (go.mod, package.json) for the full list.
